,'s3364','chapter_28',28,'narration',3364,'','','人烟逐渐变少。不远处的树荫底下，有少女的声音传来。','','','','','s3365',''),(3366,'s3365','chapter_29',29,'set',3365,'','','','','','event_cg_mode','true','s3366',''),(3367,'s3366','chapter_29',29,'set',3366,'','','','','','ai_sprite_mode','false','s3367',''),(3368,'s3367','chapter_29',29,'scene',3367,'','','','cg ch29_idol_practice','','','','s3368',''),(3369,'s3368','chapter_29',29,'narration',3368,'','','一切因你而起','','','','','s3369',''),(3370,'s3369','chapter_29',29,'narration',3369,'','','四个少女在树荫下练习步伐。星野爱站在后方，认真跟着节拍。','','','','','s3370',''),(3371,'s3370','chapter_29',29,'narration',3370,'','','右上角的女生注意到顾天鹏，动作慢了一拍。练习停下来，节拍声也跟着断掉。','','','','','s3371',''),(3372,'s3371','chapter_29',29,'set',3371,'','','','','','event_cg_mode','false','s3372',''),(3373,'s3372','chapter_29',29,'scene',3372,'','','','bg ch28_ochanomizu_steps','','','','s3373',''),(3374,'s3373','chapter_29',29,'sprite',3373,'','','','','[{\"image\": \"sanae practice\", \"pos\": \"cast_group_left\"}]','','','s3374',''),(3375,'s3374','chapter_29',29,'sprite',3374,'','','','','[{\"image\": \"ritsuko practice\", \"pos\": \"cast_group_midleft\"}]','','','s3375',''),(3376,'s3375','chapter_29',29,'sprite',3375,'','','','','[{\"image\": \"heroine ch29_practice\", \"pos\": \"cast_group_midright\"}]','','','s3376',''),(3377,'s3376','chapter_29',29,'sprite',3376,'','','','','[{\"image\": \"mai practice\", \"pos\": \"cast_group_right\"}]','','','s3377',''),(3378,'s3377','chapter_29',29,'dialogue',3377,'sanae','高峰早苗','精神集中一点啦。我们时间不多，动作不整齐的话，到时候会被淘汰。','','','','','s3378',''),(3379,'s3378','chapter_29',29,'dialogue',3378,'mai','渡边麻衣','早上练了那么久，中午吃完饭又练到现在，稍微休息一下比较合适吧。','','','','','s3379',''),(3380,'s3379','chapter_29',29,'dialogue',3379,'ritsuko','二宫律子','对不起，都怪我。','','','','','s3380',''),(3381,'s3380','chapter_29',29,'dialogue',3380,'ai','星野爱','没办法的吧。社长和京子小姐也很希望我们成功。','','','','','s3381',''),(3382,'s3381','chapter_29',29,'dialogue',3381,'mai','渡边麻衣','小爱，你又把社长名字叫错了。','','','','','s3382',''),(33