'','','s3738',''),(3739,'s3738','ending_bench_dawn',0,'narration',3738,'','','天快亮的时候，她没有离开。','','','','','s3739',''),(3740,'s3739','ending_bench_dawn',0,'narration',3739,'','','她只是把那封写了一半的信揉成很小的一团，塞进口袋里。','','','','','s3740',''),(3741,'s3740','ending_bench_dawn',0,'narration',3740,'','','晨光从路尽头慢慢漫过来，把那张没有寄出的信照得很亮。','','','','','s3741',''),(3742,'s3741','ending_bench_dawn',0,'end',3741,'','','','','','','',NULL,'ending_bench_dawn'),(3743,'s3742','ending_quiet_parting',0,'set',3742,'','','','','','ai_sprite_mode','false','s3743',''),(3744,'s3743','ending_quiet_parting',0,'set',3743,'','','','','','ai_sprite_position','center','s3744',''),(3745,'s3744','ending_quiet_parting',0,'set',3744,'','','','','','event_cg_mode','true','s3745',''),(3746,'s3745','ending_quiet_parting',0,'scene',3745,'','','','cg ch15_empty_room_letter','','','','s3746',''),(3747,'s3746','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3746,'','','顾天鹏醒来时，窗外的竹林被晨雾压得很低。','','','','','s3747',''),(3748,'s3747','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3747,'','','旁边的被褥已经冷了，桌上只剩一封折好的信。','','','','','s3748',''),(3749,'s3748','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3748,'','','信里没有责怪，也没有请求，只写着一句很轻的话：','','','','','s3749',''),(3750,'s3749','ending_quiet_parting',0,'dialogue',3749,'ai_letter','星野爱的信','谢谢你陪我走到这里。接下来的路，我想一个人试试看。','','','','','s3750',''),(3751,'s3750','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3750,'','','他把那句话读了很久。','','','','','s3751',''),(3752,'s3751','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3751,'','','如果昨晚多停一会儿，如果没有把她的计划当成玩笑，也许故事还会继续。','','','','','s3752',''),(3753,'s3752','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3752,'','','可是选择已经落下，像清晨合上的门。','','','','','s3753',''),(3754,'s3753','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3753,'','','她没有等到明天。','','','','','s3754',''),(3755,'s3754','ending_quiet_parting',0,'narration',3754,'','','清晨的门缝里没有回声，只剩信纸在桌上安静地等他醒来。','','','','','s3755',''),(3756,'s3755','ending_quiet_parting',0,'end',3755,'','','','','','','',NULL,'ending_quiet_parting');
